    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n6 Monument View is a well located three bedroom mid-terrace house set in a quiet cul de sac just two minutes' walk from The Clock Tower in the centre of Westport town. \n\nWith a floor area of approximately 88sqm/947 sqft, accommodation comprises of entrance hall, living room, kitchen/dining room, understair storage, three first floor bedrooms (one en suite) and bathroom.\n\nThe house would benefit from some modernisation but offers excellent potential for a conveniently located starter home or investment property. Alternatively, it would make an excellent holiday home within walking distance of Westport's many facilities.\n\nTo the rear is a small yard with access onto the Westport to Quay cycling/walking path.\n\nWestport's many amenities are within easy reach of the property. A wide range of shops are located nearby, including a supermarket just 100 metres away. The town's excellent choice of restaurants and bars are all within a few minutes' walk."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.29m x 1.06m\n\n\n& - 4.97m x 2m\n(inc. hotpress & understair storage) Laminate floor, carpeted staircase\n\nLiving Room - 3.78m x 3.3m\nCarpeted floor, solid fuel stove with a marble and wooden fireplace, curtains\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 4.97m x 3.55m\nLino floor and tiled backsplash, shaker kitchen, formica worktop, extractor fan, door to back yard\n\nFirst Floor Landing - 1.8m x 1.69m\nCarpeted floor\n\nBedroom One - 3.98m x 2.84m\n\n\n& - 1.4m x 0.85m\nSolid wood floor, built in wardrobes, curtains\n\nEn-Suite - 2.49m x 0.93m\nLino floor, tiled backsplash, electric shower, wc, whb\n\nBedroom Two - 3.64m x 2.43m\nSolid wood floor, built in wardrobes, curtains\n\nBedroom Three - 3.57m x 2.4m\nSolid wood floor, built in wardrobes, curtains\n\nBathroom - 1.95m x 1.32m\n\n\n& - 1.66m x 0.7m\nLino floor, tiled backsplash, bath, wc, whb\n\n"
      },
